# Mandatory repository policy

Read and obey the repository-root `AGENTS.md` before acting.

The only permitted working branch is the existing `seo-app-at-root`. Always make changes directly on that branch. Never create, fork, rename, or switch to any other branch. If the required branch is unavailable, stop and report the blocker; do not create a replacement.

Do not deploy, push, merge, or change repository settings without explicit user approval. Preserve unrelated working-tree changes.
